WEBVTT

00:00:06.523 --> 00:00:12.523
Choose System in the side menu.

00:00:16.215 --> 00:00:22.215
Click Storage.

00:00:24.417 --> 00:00:30.417
Check the Storage used figure
and the warning under it.

00:00:37.326 --> 00:00:43.326
Check the Videos figure in the breakdown.

00:00:48.358 --> 00:00:54.358
Choose Trash in the side menu.

00:00:57.916 --> 00:01:03.916
Scroll to Delete forever next
to a video you do not need.
